TEXT 0 264 Left 2 !.dc V1 0 15 0.1
TEXT 0 296 Left 2 !.subckt BZX5V1 A K\nD1 A K DZ\n.model DZ D(Is=1f Rs=5 BV=5.1 IBV=1m)\n.ends BZX5V1
TEXT 0 424 Left 2 ;A Zener regulator. D1 is the plain diode symbol, but its attribute Prefix X (Edit > Other
TEXT 0 448 Left 2 ;attributes) makes it call the subcircuit BZX5V1 written above, as in LTspice's attribute
TEXT 0 472 Left 2 ;editor. Run, then click the out label: V(out) follows V(in) up to about 5 V, then stays there.
